{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {

    },
    "**コンソール**（アプリケーション → ユーティリティ）を開き、左の **クラッシュレポート** を選ぶと一覧が出ます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open **Console** (Applications → Utilities) and choose **Crash Reports** on the left to see the list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finder で探すときは、**移動** → **フォルダへ移動…** に `~/Library/Logs/DiagnosticReports` と入れます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To find them in Finder, choose **Go** → **Go to Folder…** and enter `~/Library/Logs/DiagnosticReports`"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "— ページ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "— pages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ".txt で保存…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save as .txt…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "（作り直しても小さくならなかった %lld 個は元のまま）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : " (%lld image that did not get smaller was left as is)"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : " (%lld images that did not get smaller were left as is)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "（合計）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " (total)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "（画像にしても小さくならなかった図 %lld 個は元のまま）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : " (%lld figure that did not get smaller was left as is)"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : " (%lld figures that did not get smaller were left as is)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」の保存先" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where to save “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」の文字の保存先" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where to save the text of “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」は PDF が 1 つのときだけ使えます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” works only with one PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を開くパスワード" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Password to open “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「8-」は 8 ページから最後まで。書いた順に 1 つずつのファイルになります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“8-” means page 8 to the end. Each range becomes one file, in the order you write them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「おすすめの順に戻す」で最初の順に戻ります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Restore recommended order” returns to the original order"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「セキュリティ」の欄に「“LocalPDFTools”は … ブロックされました」と出ているので、**このまま開く** を押します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The “Security” section shows a message that “LocalPDFTools” was blocked …, so click **Open Anyway**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ファイルごとに保存…」— PDF 1 つにつき .txt を 1 つ作ります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Save each file…” — Creates one .txt for each PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ページを見て分ける…」で、ページの間をクリックして切ります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In “View and split pages…”, click between pages to cut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「まとめて 1 つの .txt に保存…」— 全部のファイルを、ファイル名とページ番号の見出しを付けて 1 つにまとめます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Save all as one .txt…” — Combines all files into one, with headings for file names and page numbers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「図を選ぶ…」で図の縮小表示を見ながら、画像にする図を 1 つずつ選べます。「効果なし」と出る図は、画像にしても小さくならない見込みのものです" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With “Choose figures…”, you can pick the figures to rasterize one by one while looking at their thumbnails. Figures marked “no effect” are ones that likely won’t get smaller as images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「詳細」で変えた設定です。品質を選ぶと、品質の設定に置き換わります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Custom settings from “Details”. Choosing a quality replaces them with that quality’s settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「詳細」で設定を変えると、品質はどれも選ばれていない状態になります。品質を選び直すと、詳細の設定はその品質のものに置き換わります（図を画像にするは、品質では変わりません）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you change settings in “Details”, no quality is selected anymore. If you choose a quality again, the detailed settings are replaced with that quality’s settings (Rasterize figures isn’t affected by the quality)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「詳細」の中では、次の 5 つを自分で選べます。組み合わせられます。大きさの内訳も「詳細」の中に出ます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In “Details”, you can choose the following five yourself, and combine them. The size breakdown also appears in “Details”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**%@** — %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**%@** — %@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**%1$@** — %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**1 ページずつ**: 10 ページなら 10 個の PDF にします" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**One page each**: A 10-page PDF becomes 10 PDFs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Core Graphics** — OCR の前にページを絵にする、図を画像にするときに図を描く、画像がページのどこに置かれているかを調べる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Core Graphics** — Renders pages as images before OCR, draws figures when rasterizing them, and finds where images are placed on a page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**CryptoKit** — 圧縮のときに、重複した部品を見つけるための指紋（SHA-256）を作る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**CryptoKit** — Creates fingerprints (SHA-256) used to find duplicate parts when compressing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**ImageIO** — 圧縮のときの画像の縮小と再圧縮" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**ImageIO** — Downscales and recompresses images when compressing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**JPEG の画質** — 写真やカラーのスキャンのような、もともと JPEG の画像を、選んだ画質で保存し直します。**画像が少しぼやけます**" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**JPEG quality** — Re-saves images that are already JPEG, such as photos and color scans, at the quality you choose. **Images get slightly blurrier**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**N ページごと**: 3 なら 1〜3・4〜6・… と分けます。最後は余りのページです" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Every N pages**: With 3, the pages are split as 1–3, 4–6, and so on. The last PDF gets the remaining pages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**PDFKit** — ページの縮小表示と、文字の層の読み取り" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**PDFKit** — Page thumbnails and reading the text layer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**qpdf** — PDF の中身を読み書きする部品。解除・回転・結合・分割・圧縮で使います（Apache License 2.0）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**qpdf** — A component that reads and writes the contents of PDFs. Used for Unlock, Rotate, Merge, Split, and Compress (Apache License 2.0)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Vision** — 文字認識（OCR）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Vision** — Text recognition (OCR)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**しおり**（目次）と、**PDF の中の別のページへのリンク**は、結合すると残りません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Bookmarks** (table of contents) and **links to other pages within the PDF** aren’t kept when you merge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**しおり**（目次）と、**PDF の中の別のページへのリンク**は残りません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Bookmarks** (table of contents) and **links to other pages within the PDF** aren’t kept"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**システム設定** → **プライバシーとセキュリティ** を開きます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open **System Settings** → **Privacy & Security**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**フォントを小さな形式に作り直す**（見た目は変わりません）— LaTeX で作った PDF などに入っている Type1 という形式のフォントを、同じ形の CFF という小さな形式に作り直します。字の形は同じ座標のまま書き写すので、見た目は変わりません。Type1 のフォントは中身が暗号化されていて圧縮が効かず、使わない部品も入っているため、数分の 1 になることがあります（iLovePDF なども同じことをしています）。作り直せない形のフォントは、元のまま残します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Rebuild fonts in a smaller format** (appearance doesn’t change) — Rebuilds fonts in the Type1 format, found in PDFs made with LaTeX and the like, into CFF, a smaller format with the same shapes. The glyph shapes are copied with exactly the same coordinates, so the appearance doesn’t change. Type1 fonts are encrypted inside, so compression doesn’t work on them, and they also contain unused parts, so they can shrink to a fraction of their size (iLovePDF and others do the same thing). Fonts in a form that can’t be rebuilt are left as they are"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**中** — 画像を 150 dpi まで縮め、JPEG を画質「中」で保存し直します。画面で読むには十分です" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Medium** — Downscales images to 150 dpi and re-saves JPEGs at “Medium” quality. Good enough for reading on screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**低** — 画像を 100 dpi まで縮め、JPEG を画質「低」で保存し直します。拡大すると画像の粗さが分かります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Low** — Downscales images to 100 dpi and re-saves JPEGs at “Low” quality. You can see the images are rough when you zoom in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**分割がオンのとき**: 場所を 1 回だけ選ぶと、そこに新しいフォルダを作って、分けた PDF をまとめて入れます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**When Split is on**: Choose a location just once, and the app creates a new folder there and puts all the split PDFs in it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**切れ目を選ぶ**: 「ページを見て分ける…」で、ページの間をクリックしたところで切ります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Choose cut points**: In “View and split pages…”, click between pages to cut there"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**制限あり**（橙の札）— 開けるけれど、印刷・コピー・編集などが禁止されている PDF。パスワードを入れなくても外せます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Restricted** (orange badge) — A PDF you can open, but printing, copying, editing, and so on are prohibited. You can remove this without entering a password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**図の線を減らす** — matplotlib などで作ったグラフ向け。補助グリッド線と補助目盛を消す、曲線の点を間引く、の 2 つです。圧縮をオンにすると最初から 2 つとも選ばれていて、減らせる本数が「詳細」の中に出ます。**線を消すと見た目が変わります**（点を間引くほうは、見た目はほぼ変わりません）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Thin out figure lines** — For graphs made with matplotlib and similar tools. It covers two things: removing minor grid lines and minor ticks, and simplifying curves. When you turn on Compress, both are selected from the start, and the number of lines that can be removed appears in “Details”. **Removing lines changes the appearance** (simplifying curves barely changes the appearance)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**図を画像にする**（最初はオフ）— 点や線がとても多いグラフ（何万点もの散布図など）を、同じ位置・同じ大きさの画像に置き換えます。**図の中の文字は画像になり、選択・検索できなくなります**。本文の文字はそのまま残ります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Rasterize figures** (off at first) — Replaces graphs with a huge number of points or lines (such as scatter plots with tens of thousands of points) with an image at the same position and size. **Text inside the figure becomes part of the image and can no longer be selected or searched**. The body text stays as it is"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**構造の圧縮**（最初からオン）— PDF の中の小さな部品をまとめて、データの圧縮をし直します。**見た目は一切変わりません**" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Structural compression** (on from the start) — Groups the small parts inside the PDF together and recompresses the data. **The appearance doesn’t change at all**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**目標**に提出先の上限（MB）を入れると、収まりそうなら緑、超えそうなら赤で示します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the size limit (MB) of the site you upload to in **Target**, and it shows green if the file is likely to fit and red if it’s likely to go over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**範囲を書く**: `1-3, 4-7, 8-` のように書きます。書いた順に 1 つずつの PDF になります。`8-` は 8 ページから最後までです。範囲を 1 つだけ書けば、一部のページだけを取り出せます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Enter ranges**: Write ranges like `1-3, 4-7, 8-`. Each range becomes one PDF, in the order you write them. `8-` means page 8 to the end. Write just one range to take out only some of the pages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**結合がオフのとき**: ファイルごとに別々に保存します。ファイルごとに保存のダイアログが出ます（初期の名前は、元の名前に _unlocked・_rotated などを付けたもの）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**When Merge is off**: Each file is saved separately. A save dialog appears for each file (the default name is the original name with _unlocked, _rotated, etc. added)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**結合がオンのとき**: 1 つの PDF にして保存します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**When Merge is on**: Everything is saved as one PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**自分が権利を持つ書類にだけ使ってください**。他人の書類や、保護を外すことが許されていない書類には使わないでください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Use this only on documents you have the rights to**. Don’t use it on other people’s documents or on documents whose protection you aren’t allowed to remove"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**色の無い画像を灰色で保存し直す**（見た目はほぼ変わりません）— 白黒の書類をカラーで読み取ったときのように、RGB（カラー）で保存されているのに白・黒・灰色しか無い画像を、灰色の画像として保存し直します。印鑑・署名・蛍光ペンなど、色の付いた部分が少しでもある画像は、そのままにします" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Re-save colorless images as grayscale** (appearance barely changes) — Re-saves images that are stored as RGB (color) but contain only white, black, and gray, such as a black-and-white document scanned in color, as grayscale images. Images with even a little color, such as a seal stamp, signature, or highlighter, are left as they are"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**要パスワード**（赤の札）— 開くのにパスワードが要る PDF。正しいパスワードを入れると外せます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Password required** (red badge) — A PDF that needs a password to open. You can remove this by entering the correct password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**要らないデータを捨てる**（見た目は変わりません）— Illustrator や Photoshop が、自分で編集し直すために PDF に入れておくデータ・ページの小さな縮小画像・画像やページに付いた説明のデータ（撮影や編集の履歴など）を捨てます。Illustrator で保存した PDF では、編集用のデータが大部分を占めていて、大きく減ることがあります。文書全体の説明（題名・作成者など）・しおり・添付ファイル・読み上げ用の構造・フォームは残します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Discard unneeded data** (appearance doesn’t change) — Discards data that Illustrator and Photoshop put in a PDF so they can edit it again later, small page thumbnails, and descriptive data attached to images and pages (such as capture and editing history). In PDFs saved from Illustrator, the editing data takes up most of the file, so the size can drop a lot. Document-wide information (title, author, etc.), bookmarks, attachments, the structure used for reading aloud, and forms are kept"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**解像度** — 選んだ dpi（300・200・150・100・72）より細かい画像だけを縮めます。それより粗い画像には触りません。**画像が粗くなります**" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Resolution** — Downscales only images finer than the dpi you choose (300, 200, 150, 100, or 72). Coarser images are left untouched. **Images get rougher**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**試算する** を押すと、実際に圧縮して大きさを測ります（作った PDF はすぐ消します）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click **Run trial** to actually compress and measure the size (the PDF it makes is deleted right away)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**重複をまとめる**（見た目は変わりません）— 中身がまったく同じ画像・フォント・色の設定などが何回も入っているとき、1 つだけ残して、ほかはその 1 つを使うようにします。結合した PDF に、同じロゴやフォントが元のファイルの数だけ入っているときに効きます。matplotlib の図をたくさん入れた PDF では、図ごとに入っている同じ字形もまとまります。フォントの情報や字幅の表のような小さな部品も、中身が同じならまとめます（ページ・注釈・しおり・フォームの欄・レイヤーのように 1 つずつ別でなければならないものは、まとめません）。「同じ」とみなすのは、データが 1 バイト残らず同じものだけです" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Merge duplicates** (appearance doesn’t change) — When identical images, fonts, color settings, and so on appear many times, only one is kept and the others are made to use it. This helps when a merged PDF contains the same logo or font once for every original file. In PDFs with many matplotlib figures, the identical glyphs included in each figure are merged too. Small parts such as font information and glyph width tables are also merged if their contents are the same (things that must each stay separate, such as pages, annotations, bookmarks, form fields, and layers, are not merged). Only data that is identical down to the last byte counts as “the same”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**高** — 300 dpi より細かい画像だけを縮めます。JPEG の画質は変えません。見た目はほとんど変わりません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**High** — Downscales only images finer than 300 dpi. JPEG quality isn’t changed. The appearance barely changes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
