    "PDF をここにドロップ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drop PDFs here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を丸ごと作り直す道具（Ghostscript など）は使っていません。選んだ部分だけを変え、それ以外はそのまま残すためです。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It doesn’t use tools that rebuild the whole PDF (such as Ghostscript). That way, it changes only the parts you choose and leaves everything else as it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を保存" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save the PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を入れて、やりたい操作をオンにして、保存するだけです" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just add PDFs, turn on the actions you want, and save"
