    },
    "PDF を入れて、やることをオンにしてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add PDFs and turn on an action"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を入れてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add a PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を入れる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add PDFs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を入れると、圧縮したあとの**目安**がカードに出ます（大きさの内訳は「詳細」の中）。目安は見積もりなので、実際とずれます。いつも行う 4 つの分は目安に入っていません（調べるのに画像やフォントのデータを全部読む必要があり、時間がかかるため）。その分、実際は目安より小さくなることがあります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you add PDFs, an **Estimate** of the size after compression appears on the card (the size breakdown is in “Details”). The estimate is only an estimate, so the actual result will differ. It doesn’t include the four things that are always done (checking them would mean reading all the image and font data, which takes time). Because of that, the actual file may end up smaller than the estimate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を入れると、大きさの内訳を出します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add a PDF to see a size breakdown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を入れると、重い図（描く命令が 5,000 個以上、または線や点のデータが 100 KB 以上の図）を探し、オフのままでも、見つかった数と減らせる見込みを「詳細」の中に出します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you add PDFs, the app looks for heavy figures (figures with 5,000 or more drawing commands, or 100 KB or more of line and point data) and, even while this is off, shows in “Details” how many it found and how much they could likely save."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF を追加" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
