          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an app crashes, your Mac automatically saves what was happening in a file called a “crash report.” Its name starts with “LocalPDFTools” if this app crashed, or with “qpdf” if qpdf, which processes the PDFs, crashed. The name ends in “.ips.”"
