    "フォルダ名" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folder name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォルダ名に「/」「:」は使えません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folder names can’t contain “/” or “:”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォルダ名の初期値は、元の名前に _split を付けたものです。中の PDF は `元の名前_p1-3.pdf`（1 ページだけなら `元の名前_p4.pdf`）です" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The default folder name is the original name with _split added. The PDFs inside are named `original name_p1-3.pdf` (or `original name_p4.pdf` for a single page)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォルダ名を「.」で始めると Finder に表示されません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folder names starting with “.” don’t appear in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォルダ名を入れてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter a folder name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォント" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fonts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォント %lld 個を小さな形式（CFF）に作り直し" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "rebuilt %lld font in a smaller format (CFF)"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "rebuilt %lld fonts in a smaller format (CFF)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォントの作り直しでは、Type1 の暗号を解いて字の描き方を 1 つずつ実行し、出てきた線と曲線を CFF の描き方で書き直します。字の形を整える手がかり（ヒント）も、CFF で書ける範囲で写します。知らない命令があるフォントは作り直しません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To rebuild a font, the app decrypts the Type1 font, runs each glyph’s drawing instructions one by one, and rewrites the resulting lines and curves as CFF drawing instructions. The clues for shaping glyphs (hints) are also copied as far as CFF can express them. Fonts containing unknown instructions aren’t rebuilt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォントや、いくつものページで使う画像が、分けた PDF のそれぞれに入るためです。提出先の上限は 1 ファイルごとに効くので、結果の欄の「一番大きいファイル」を見てください。小さくしたいときは圧縮もオンにします。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is because fonts, and images used on many pages, are included in each of the split PDFs. The size limit of the site you upload to applies to each file, so check “Largest file” in the results. To make the files smaller, turn on Compress too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォントや、いくつものページで使う画像は、分けた PDF のそれぞれに入るので、合計は元より大きくなることがあります。提出先の大きさの上限は 1 ファイルごとに効くので、結果の欄の「一番大きいファイル」を見てください。圧縮もオンにすると、分けた PDF をそれぞれ圧縮します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fonts, and images used on many pages, are included in each of the split PDFs, so the total can be larger than the original. The size limit of the site you upload to applies to each file, so check “Largest file” in the results. If Compress is also on, each split PDF is compressed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ふだんは品質を 3 つから選ぶだけです。細かい設定は「詳細」を押すと開きます。最初は「高」です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Normally you just pick one of three qualities. Click “Details” to open the detailed settings. “High” is selected at first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
