            "value" : "If a folder with the same name already exists, the app doesn’t use it and creates a new folder with a number added, such as “name 2”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ形の破線が 20 本以上繰り返すもの（補助グリッド線）と、文書の中で一番短い目盛で同じ形が 20 本以上繰り返すもの（補助目盛）を消します。数本の参照線と主目盛は残します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removes dashed lines of the same shape repeated 20 or more times (minor grid lines) and the shortest ticks in the document repeated 20 or more times (minor ticks). A few reference lines and the major ticks are kept"
