    "図を画像にする: オン（詳細で選んだ図）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rasterize figures: On (figures chosen in Details)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "図を画像にするときは、図だけを Mac の部品で白い背景に描いて 1 枚の画像にし、図の中身をその画像に差し替えます。画像は画質の落ちない形で保存します。白黒・灰色だけの図は、色の情報を持たない形にして小さくします。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To rasterize figures, the app draws just the figure on a white background with macOS components to make a single image, and replaces the figure’s contents with that image. The image is saved in a lossless format. Figures that are only black, white, and gray are stored without color information to make them smaller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "図を選ぶ…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose figures…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮（フォントの作り直し）: `qpdf --json-object=… --json-stream-data=file` で Type1 のフォントを取り出す → このアプリの中で CFF に書き直す → `qpdf --update-from-json` で /FontFile を /FontFile3（/Type1C）に差し替える" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress (rebuilding fonts): extract Type1 fonts with `qpdf --json-object=… --json-stream-data=file` → rewrite them as CFF inside this app → replace /FontFile with /FontFile3 (/Type1C) using `qpdf --update-from-json`"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮（図を画像にする）: qpdf で図だけを並べた一時的な PDF を作る → Core Graphics で描く → `qpdf --update-from-json` で図の中身を画像に差し替える" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress (rasterizing figures): make a temporary PDF containing only the figures with qpdf → draw them with Core Graphics → replace the figures’ contents with images using `qpdf --update-from-json`"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮（構造）: `qpdf --object-streams=generate --recompress-flate`" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress (structure): `qpdf --object-streams=generate --recompress-flate`"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮（画像）: qpdf で画像を取り出し → ImageIO で作り直し → `qpdf --update-from-json` で元の場所に戻す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress (images): extract images with qpdf → rebuild them with ImageIO → put them back in place with `qpdf --update-from-json`"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮（要らないデータ・重複の付け替え・色の無い画像）: 書き換えた部品だけを `qpdf --update-from-json` で戻す。使われなくなった部品は、qpdf が書き出すときに捨てる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress (unneeded data, redirecting duplicates, colorless images): put back only the rewritten parts with `qpdf --update-from-json`. qpdf discards parts that are no longer used when it writes the file"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮（重複を探す）: `qpdf --json --json-object=… --json-stream-data=file` で候補の部品のデータだけを取り出す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress (finding duplicates): extract only the data of candidate parts with `qpdf --json --json-object=… --json-stream-data=file`"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮が最後なのは、提出先の大きさの上限に関わるのは、最後にできたファイルの大きさだからです。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compress comes last because what counts for the upload site’s size limit is the size of the final file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮したのに、ほとんど小さくならない・大きくなった" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I compressed it, but it barely got smaller, or got larger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圧縮をオンにすると、上の方法とは別に、次の 4 つを毎回行います。カードに選ぶ欄はありません。当てはまるものが無い PDF では何もしません。行ったときは、保存したあとの結果に数が出ます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When Compress is on, the following four things are done every time, separately from the methods above. There’s nothing to choose on the card. For a PDF where none of them applies, nothing happens. When they are done, the counts appear in the result after saving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
