    "解除も結合もオンにしないで回転や圧縮だけをしたときは、保護を付けたまま保存します（黙って外すことはしません）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you only Rotate or Compress without turning on Unlock or Merge, the file is saved with its protection still on (it never removes it without telling you)"
          }
