    "選んだ方法による" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depends on the method"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重い図 %lld 個（オンにすると約 %@ 減らせる見込み・目安）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heavy figures: %1$lld (turning this on saves about %2$@, estimate)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重い図 %1$lld 個（オンにすると約 %2$@ 減らせる見込み・目安）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重い図 %lld 個（画像にしても小さくならない見込み）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heavy figures: %lld (not expected to get smaller as images)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重い図 %lld 個のうち %lld 個を画像にする" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rasterize %2$lld of %1$lld heavy figures"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重い図 %1$lld 個のうち %2$lld 個を画像にする"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重い図は見つかりませんでした" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No heavy figures were found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重複していた部品 %lld 個を 1 つにまとめ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "merged %lld duplicate object"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "merged %lld duplicate objects"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重複は、まず部品の一覧で「長さと中身の説明が同じ」ものを探し、それだけのデータを取り出して指紋（SHA-256）で比べます。まとめた方への参照を付け替えると、使われなくなった重複と、捨てた要らないデータは、保存するときに PDF から無くなります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To find duplicates, the app first looks in the list of parts for ones with “the same length and the same description of contents,” then extracts only their data and compares fingerprints (SHA-256). Once references are redirected to the one that’s kept, the unused duplicates and the discarded unneeded data are removed from the PDF when it’s saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開くのにパスワードが要ります。パスワードはここで 1 回だけ聞き、保存しません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A password is needed to open this. You’ll be asked once here, and it is not saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開くのにパスワードが要る PDF は、ページを表示できないので、ここでは回せません。先に解除して保存した PDF を入れ直すと回せます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A PDF that needs a password to open can’t show its pages, so it can’t be rotated here. Unlock and save it first, then add that PDF again to rotate it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開くのにパスワードが要る PDF は、必要になった時点で小さな窓で聞きます。入れたパスワードはその場の処理に使うだけで、どこにも保存しません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a PDF that needs a password to open, a small window asks for it when it’s needed. The password you enter is used only for that task and is never saved anywhere."
          }
        }
